            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "STS Electronic Recycling provides chain of custody records, serialized asset reporting, and certificates of destruction based on the service selected. These records help Bakersfield organizations document the collection, handling, and final disposition of retired IT equipment for internal closeout procedures."
