            "text": "STS Electronic Recycling serves the entire Bakersfield metropolitan area including Seven Oaks, Rosedale, Stockdale, Downtown, and Oildale, as well as broader Kern County communities including Delano, Shafter, Wasco, Taft, Arvin, and the San Joaquin Valley freight corridors."
